(7770139, 1289946, 3306, '<td valign="top">
POST CHALLENGE NOTE: I asked the site council to disqualify this image. I received a comment from glad2badad  asking if a DPC member had taken the picture since I am in it. I realized that even though I had directed the assistant to take the image I did not set it up for her. I recognized when the comment was made that it didn''t  follow the rules of DPC and thus asked for it to be DQ''ed. I assure you that this is the only time I have ever submitted a picture in this manner.  I have always set the picture up, used a delayed timer or remote trigger or had my wife press the shutter of the set up picture if I was in it which I believe is allowed. Sorry for the inadvertent error.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2024-09-18 00:04:49.</i></td>', 'POST CHALLENGE NOTE: I asked the site council to disqualify this image. I received a comment from glad2badad  asking if a DPC member had taken the picture since I am in it. I realized that even though I had directed the assistant to take the image I did not set it up for her. I recognized when the comment was made that it didn''t  follow the rules of DPC and thus asked for it to be DQ''ed. I assure you that this is the only time I have ever submitted a picture in this manner.  I have always set the picture up, used a delayed timer or remote trigger or had my wife press the shutter of the set up picture if I was in it which I believe is allowed. Sorry for the inadvertent error.', '2024-09-18 00:02:37.000000', '2024-09-18 00:04:49.000000', 0),
