(7786805, 1290019, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> There is a lot going on in this picture, and I find it interesting.  I think you did a nice job meeting the challenge, but the technical aspects of the capture could have been a good deal better.
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> This one feels like a snapshot.  Your description confirms that, and I think that is why you were voted low.  I think it needs an area of focus to really pull the eye toward the subject(s).
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> I think this one scored fairly appropriately.  I did not vote in this challenge, but this one would have pulled a 3 or 4 from me.  Thanks for sharing!
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: There is a lot going on in this picture, and I find it interesting.  I think you did a nice job meeting the challenge, but the technical aspects of the capture could have been a good deal better.

My ideas for improvement:  This one feels like a snapshot.  Your description confirms that, and I think that is why you were voted low.  I think it needs an area of focus to really pull the eye toward the subject(s).

Where I would have/did score this entry: I think this one scored fairly appropriately.  I did not vote in this challenge, but this one would have pulled a 3 or 4 from me.  Thanks for sharing!

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-11 12:00:26.000000', NULL, 0);
